path.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T08:45:55-07:00","id":888246,"title":"","content":"In case anyone is interested, the Modifier podcast wrangled a lawyer onto the show to explain the new OGL.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://oneshotpodcast.com/podcasts/modifier/7-modifier-gets-a-lawyer/\" target=\"_blank\">http://oneshotpodcast.com/podcasts/m...gets-a-lawyer/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><a href=\"http://maidrpg.com\" target=\"_blank\">Maids</a> </span><span style=\"color:#404040\">+ Exalted = <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/maidzalt\" target=\"_blank\">Maid the RPG: Exalted Edition</a>! More chaos than you can shake an artifact feather duster at! Also, my <a href=\"https://www.obsidianportal.com/profile/Teleute\" target=\"_blank\">Obsidian Portal page</a>.</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1853-teleute","name":"teleute","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1853_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T08:54:40-07:00","id":888255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>teleute</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/801677-is-using-5th-edition-legal?p=888246#post888246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" cl